#: tracker/web/templates/_page_id_help.html:3
msgid "How do I find a page ID?"
msgstr "如何查找主页 ID？"

#: tracker/web/templates/_page_id_help.html:5
msgid ""
"Open the <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Meta Ad Library</a> and search for the advertiser."
msgstr ""
"打开 <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Meta 广告资料库</a>，搜索广告主。"

#: tracker/web/templates/_page_id_help.html:6
msgid ""
"Click the advertiser's name. The address now contains <code>view_all_page_id=</code> followed by "
"digits: that's the page ID."
msgstr "点击广告主名称，网址中的 <code>view_all_page_id=</code> 后方数字就是主页 ID。"

#: tracker/web/templates/_page_id_help.html:7
msgid "Don't use the Library ID shown on an ad: that identifies one ad, not the page."
msgstr "请勿使用广告上显示的资料库编号（Library ID），它标识单条广告，不是主页 ID。"

