msgstr "每次采集任务（最多读取 5 个主页）"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:45
msgid "free every month on Apify's free plan"
msgstr "Apify 免费套餐每月提供的免费额度"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:47
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Apify's free plan gives US$ %(credit)s of usage every month, with no credit card. That's about "
"%(ads)s ads a month at no cost. Unused credit doesn't carry over to the next month."
msgstr "Apify 免费套餐每月提供 %(credit)s 美元用量额度，无需信用卡；约可采集 %(ads)s 条广告。未用完的额度不会结转到下个月。"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:49
msgid "An example"
msgstr "费用示例"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:50
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(pages)s competitors with about %(per_page)s active ads each: one collection reads about %(ads)s"
" ads and costs about US$ %(cost)s."
msgstr "追踪 %(pages)s 个竞品，每个约有 %(per_page)s 条在投广告：一次采集约读取 %(ads)s 条广告，费用约 %(cost)s 美元。"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:52
msgid "About per month"
msgstr "每月费用估算"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:54
