"Each collection reads every active ad of your competitors again, so the cost grows with how many "
"ads they run and how often you collect. Settings shows what Apify charged for every collection."
msgstr "每次采集都会重新读取竞品的全部在投广告，因此广告数量越多、采集越频繁，费用越高。“设置”页会显示每次采集的 Apify 实际费用。"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:59
